WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.567
Want to show you the

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.601
exclusive access

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.869
that CNN has been given

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:03.636
to the massive

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:05.705
international security operation

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.574
to keep vital infrastructure safe

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:09.876
from Russia's military in Ukraine.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:10.744
A military,

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:12.212
of course, that is both reckless

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:13.546
and irresponsible in addition

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.215
to targeting that infrastructure,

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.883
a military that Russia continues

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:17.851
to celebrate.

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:19.319
The defense minister today

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.620
decorating the pilots

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.221
who took down

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:23.390
that American drone over the Black Sea,

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.492
even though it appeared to be accidental

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:26.593
that they hit it.

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:27.494
I want to start with Fred

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.496
Pleitgen and his exclusive reporting

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:29.763
on how

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.464
the international community is bracing

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.633
for possible new attacks by Russia.

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:34.834
He's OUTFRONT live tonight

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.002
in Bergen, Norway.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.338
And Fred, what are you learning

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:39.773
there?

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:40.974
And we're learning that NATO

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:41.741
and the US alliance

00:00:41.741 --> 00:00:43.710
certainly are not taking any chances

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.911
as far as that is concerned.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.579
They saw what happened to that U.S.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.747
drone over the Black Sea,

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.516
and they're extremely concerned

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.084
about critical infrastructure

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:53.219
among the US's allies here in Europe,

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.422
specifically energy infrastructure.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:56.322
So what we did today is

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.757
we went on to the North Sea

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.492
on one of the biggest gas

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:01.227
platforms on the North Sea,

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:01.928
and we saw that

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.463
NATO was really beefing up

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:04.230
its presence there.

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:04.864
Here's what we learned.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.300
As tensions

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:08.468
mount after the collision

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.737
between a Russian plane and a U.S.

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.605
drone over the Black Sea,

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:13.406
NATO's head

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:14.007
tells me

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:15.108
the alliance stands

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:17.210
firmly behind the U.S..

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:19.245
What you're seeing is a

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:22.182
reckless and irresponsible behavior

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:23.283
by Russia

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:25.151
that led to this incident in the

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.386
Black Sea.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:27.353
The good thing

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:29.022
is that the United States

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:31.491
behaves with the utmost professionalism.

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:35.328
And security on the seas is a huge issue

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:36.229
for NADO.

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.363
We flew to one of Europe's

00:01:37.363 --> 00:01:38.798
largest gas fields

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.066
with the secretary general

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.168
and the head of the EU commission

00:01:42.168 --> 00:01:44.571
as NATO's warships were guarding the rig.

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:47.407
Watchful for possible acts of sabotage

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:48.541
the U.S.

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:49.742
and its allies understand full

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:51.144
well that Russia's war in

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.579
Ukraine is a threat

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:54.948
not just to the skies above the seas

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:56.282
and on the seas,

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:57.884
but also to critical infrastructure

00:01:57.884 --> 00:01:59.219
under the sea as well.

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.653
That's why the NATO alliance

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:02.522
is beefing up its efforts

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.457
to protect this critical infrastructure.

00:02:05.892 --> 00:02:06.559
These are

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:07.327
the actual

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:10.230
wells of the troll gas field near Norway.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.165
Around 10% of the natural

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:12.832
gas supplies

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:13.533
for America's

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.868
European allies

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.769
come from this field alone.

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:18.738
After most of them stop buying gas

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:20.240
from Russia

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.107
last year,

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:23.143
the Nord Stream pipeline between Germany

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:24.344
and Russia was blown up.

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:25.111
And what the U.S.

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.247
says was an act of sabotage

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.516
While some believe Ukrainians

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:31.351
might be behind the explosion,

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:33.186
Kiev denies involvement.

00:02:33.186 --> 00:02:34.921
And the EU commission head tells me

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:37.357
Europe will continue to support Ukraine.

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:39.092
We know in the European Union

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.894
that Ukraine is not only fighting

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:42.195
for its independence,

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:44.197
sovereignty and freedom,

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:48.368
but also for the wider values we share,

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:49.636
like the respect

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:52.105
for the international law.

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:53.473
And the Ukrainians

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:55.241
say they will fight off.

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:55.875
Kiev saying

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:57.076
the most intense battles

00:02:57.076 --> 00:02:59.078
are still taking place around

00:02:59.078 --> 00:02:59.646
Mount

00:02:59.646 --> 00:03:00.346
where the Russians

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:01.848
claim they're gaining ground.

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:03.516
And Russian

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:04.651
President Vladimir Putin

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:06.586
is set to meet Chinese leader Xi

00:03:06.586 --> 00:03:08.821
Jinping in Moscow next week

00:03:08.955 --> 00:03:10.023
as the Russians are looking

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:11.691
to further deepen ties.

00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:12.325
And the U.S.

00:03:12.325 --> 00:03:12.926
believes

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:16.095
want Beijing to give them weapons.

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:18.198
NATO's leader says security in Europe

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:20.033
will only be guaranteed

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.368
if Putin ends the war against Ukraine.

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:26.673
The best way to reduce risks of incidents

00:03:26.806 --> 00:03:28.908
like this is, of course, to end the war.

00:03:29.209 --> 00:03:31.911
Wars are dangerous and they lead

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.446
to dangerous situations

00:03:33.446 --> 00:03:35.381
like the instance over the.

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:36.416
But as long as the war

00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:37.617
continues, NATO

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:39.752
says its ships will stay on alert,

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:41.588
shielding the alliance members

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:42.855
critical infrastructure

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:45.325
from possible attacks.

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:46.793
And new air.

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:47.894
And there are several warships

00:03:47.894 --> 00:03:48.428
from the NATO's

00:03:48.428 --> 00:03:50.496
alliance around that gas platform alone

00:03:50.496 --> 00:03:52.232
just to show how important that is.

00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:53.166
In the meantime, of course,

00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.901
we know that the fighting in Ukraine

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:56.102
is really ferocious

00:03:56.102 --> 00:03:57.337
and continues to be ferocious.

00:03:57.337 --> 00:03:58.171
I got an update

00:03:58.171 --> 00:03:59.339
from the Ukrainian military

00:03:59.339 --> 00:03:59.739
and they say

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.741
especially on the northeastern

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:02.642
front in Kremlin,

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:03.943
and there's a lot of fighting going on.

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:05.878
But of course, also, as you mentioned,

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:06.679
in Bermuda

00:04:06.679 --> 00:04:07.113
as well,

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:07.981
where the Russians

00:04:07.981 --> 00:04:08.881
are continuing

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.383
those efforts to try to encircle

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:10.883
that city.

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:12.719
While at the same time, as you said,

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:14.187
some Ukrainian soldiers believe

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:15.688
that they might have exhausted

00:04:15.688 --> 00:04:16.689
that Russian force

00:04:16.689 --> 00:04:18.424
and they could see an opening

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:19.826
to try and launch a counterattack

00:04:19.826 --> 00:04:20.994
there as well Erin.

00:04:20.994 --> 00:04:22.662
All right. Thank you very much.

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:23.429
And let's go

00:04:23.429 --> 00:04:24.764
now to Crystal grows out of the lead

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:26.666
Russia investigator for Bellingcat.

00:04:26.666 --> 00:04:27.367
He has been put on

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:28.701
Russia's wanted list

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:30.003
for his work, uncovering

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:31.571
the man who poisoned

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:34.140
Putin, opposition leader Alexei Navalny.

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:35.642
And you can see all of that,

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:36.476
of course, in the now

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:38.478
Oscar winning documentary, Navalny.

00:04:38.478 --> 00:04:39.579
Also OUTFRONT,

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:40.413
Phillips O'Brien,

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:41.814
professor of strategic studies

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:42.882
at the University

00:04:42.882 --> 00:04:43.783
of St Andrews, who,

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.652
of course, has been so tirelessly

00:04:45.652 --> 00:04:47.253
chronicling and following this war.

00:04:47.253 --> 00:04:49.622
So thanks so much to both of you.

00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:51.691
Let me start with you, Phil.

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:53.559
Fred mentioned

00:04:53.559 --> 00:04:55.028
Putin's upcoming meeting with the Chinese

00:04:55.028 --> 00:04:56.029
President Xi.

00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:56.829
And the U.S.

00:04:56.829 --> 00:04:58.531
believes that that meeting is in part

00:04:58.531 --> 00:04:59.599
because Putin wants China

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:01.601
to give him more weapons.

00:05:01.801 --> 00:05:02.669
And I know

00:05:02.669 --> 00:05:04.370
you've been looking at a lot of this.

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.505
How bad is Putin's

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:07.640
weapon shortage right now?

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:08.041
Well,

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:08.574
I mean,

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:09.509
we have to understand,

00:05:09.509 --> 00:05:11.911
Russia's not a great power economically.

00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:14.814
It's really a relatively small economy.

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.382
It's not a productive economy.

00:05:16.382 --> 00:05:18.451
It's a resource extraction economy.

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:22.221
It can't make nearly the amount of war

00:05:22.221 --> 00:05:22.922
material

00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:25.391
that it is using up at a vast rate.

00:05:25.391 --> 00:05:26.926
I mean, before the war, say

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:27.660
it was making

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.661
200 tanks

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:30.596
a year was one of the estimates.

00:05:30.596 --> 00:05:32.765
And yet they've lost

00:05:32.765 --> 00:05:34.667
six to 700 tanks

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:36.302
that we've seen destroyed.

00:05:36.302 --> 00:05:37.670
And there probably

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.238
could be hundreds and hundreds

00:05:39.238 --> 00:05:41.074
more that have also been destroyed.

00:05:41.074 --> 00:05:42.542
So if Russia is going to be left

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:44.777
fighting to its own devices,

00:05:44.777 --> 00:05:46.112
it will run out of weapons.

00:05:46.112 --> 00:05:47.847
It will run out of a lot of weapons

00:05:47.847 --> 00:05:49.615
much sooner than anyone

00:05:49.615 --> 00:05:51.484
anticipated a year ago.

00:05:51.484 --> 00:05:53.986
So if Russia is going to fight a long war

00:05:54.287 --> 00:05:55.355
and that seems to be

00:05:55.355 --> 00:05:57.390
what Putin is saying now,

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:00.093
he's going to need to get a regular

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:00.860
and steady

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.162
supply of Chinese weapons to do that.

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:04.864
Well, it's pretty incredible.

00:06:04.864 --> 00:06:05.631
And you lay that out, right?

00:06:05.631 --> 00:06:06.632
I mean, you're talking about

00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:08.735
knowing that they've lost an eight year

00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:10.103
supply of tanks, as you're saying.

00:06:10.103 --> 00:06:10.503
And that's

00:06:10.503 --> 00:06:12.739
that's obviously a very low estimate.

00:06:12.739 --> 00:06:13.906
So, you know, Chris,

00:06:13.906 --> 00:06:15.375
when the context of this,

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:16.809
the International Criminal Court

00:06:16.809 --> 00:06:17.543
making Putin

00:06:17.543 --> 00:06:19.045
a formal international pariah.

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:20.346
Right. With this warrant. Right.

00:06:20.346 --> 00:06:21.881
So it's not as if

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:22.749
anyone in the world

00:06:22.749 --> 00:06:23.383
is going to change

00:06:23.383 --> 00:06:24.784
how they see this based on this,

00:06:24.784 --> 00:06:26.152
but it makes it formal.

00:06:26.152 --> 00:06:26.686
And you've spent

00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:27.920
a lot of time investigating

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:29.756
Russian war crimes in Ukraine.

00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:31.791
So what does this mean for Putin?

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:32.125
Right.

00:06:32.125 --> 00:06:32.658
He's obviously

00:06:32.658 --> 00:06:33.760
not going to travel anywhere

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.395
that he could be arrested.

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:36.996
How does this impact him in Russia?

00:06:38.564 --> 00:06:39.332
Well, it does.

00:06:39.332 --> 00:06:39.999
And whoever

00:06:39.999 --> 00:06:41.601
says that is going to be ignored

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:43.102
or maybe even hidden from the general

00:06:43.102 --> 00:06:45.171
public is wrong or has been wrong.

00:06:45.171 --> 00:06:46.439
We see that

00:06:46.506 --> 00:06:48.174
leading Russian political figures

00:06:48.174 --> 00:06:50.076
had to comment on this today

00:06:50.076 --> 00:06:52.278
and make it even amplified in public

00:06:52.412 --> 00:06:53.146
within Russia,

00:06:53.146 --> 00:06:54.747
because a lot of bloggers,

00:06:54.747 --> 00:06:55.381
a lot of people

00:06:55.381 --> 00:06:57.183
on the Russian Telegram channel,

00:06:57.183 --> 00:06:58.785
which is the main source of information

00:06:58.785 --> 00:06:59.519
for most Russians

00:06:59.519 --> 00:06:59.986
about the war

00:06:59.986 --> 00:07:01.521
today, have started talking

00:07:01.521 --> 00:07:03.322
about the fact that he was indicted.

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:03.923
And the reason

00:07:03.923 --> 00:07:04.891
why this matters is,

00:07:04.891 --> 00:07:05.425
first of all,

00:07:05.425 --> 00:07:07.994
it eliminates a fantasy,

00:07:07.994 --> 00:07:09.228
a sort of a conspiracy theory

00:07:09.228 --> 00:07:10.263
that the Kremlin is trying

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:10.763
has been trying

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:11.330
to promulgate

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:11.964
among its people

00:07:11.964 --> 00:07:14.066
that there is this global conspiracy

00:07:14.066 --> 00:07:15.501
that protects

00:07:15.535 --> 00:07:16.702
Putin, that protects

00:07:16.702 --> 00:07:17.370
the big leaders,

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:18.871
that it's all a game that is happening

00:07:18.871 --> 00:07:20.273
and that the West will never go

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:23.409
after the big wigs and like Putin.

00:07:23.409 --> 00:07:25.578
And what happened today is literally

00:07:25.578 --> 00:07:28.581
the top wig was was indicted

00:07:28.581 --> 00:07:30.550
and an arrest warrant was issued.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.751
And think about the message

00:07:31.751 --> 00:07:32.452
that this will have

00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:34.086
for anybody below him, because, well,

00:07:34.086 --> 00:07:35.855
Putin will not be able to travel

00:07:35.855 --> 00:07:37.924
or will not travel to be arrested.

00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:39.459
I mean, a lot of people below him

00:07:39.459 --> 00:07:41.194
who know that they're committing crimes

00:07:41.194 --> 00:07:42.862
or they may be committing crimes

00:07:42.862 --> 00:07:44.931
may think twice because they're younger.

00:07:44.931 --> 00:07:46.332
They may hope to one day

00:07:46.332 --> 00:07:46.966
have to travel

00:07:46.966 --> 00:07:48.568
to their favorite destinations.

00:07:48.568 --> 00:07:49.635
I mean, even the second person

00:07:49.635 --> 00:07:51.604
who was invited, Maria Belova,

00:07:51.604 --> 00:07:53.773
she's much younger. She will.

00:07:53.773 --> 00:07:55.141
She has a hope for a new life

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:56.042
after the war.

00:07:56.042 --> 00:07:58.911
And this acts as a deterrence to Putin's

00:07:58.911 --> 00:08:00.012
commanders, to people

00:08:00.012 --> 00:08:01.614
working in the system.

00:08:01.614 --> 00:08:03.416
So to try to understand

00:08:03.416 --> 00:08:04.650
the scope of what's happening

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:05.551
on the ground here.

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:06.752
Phil, when you look at the situation

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:08.521
on the ground in commute,

00:08:08.521 --> 00:08:09.255
Ukraine is saying

00:08:09.255 --> 00:08:11.157
Russia is slowing down their attacks.

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:12.692
Obviously, I was just quoting a Russian

00:08:12.692 --> 00:08:13.793
Ukrainian soldiers saying that.

00:08:13.793 --> 00:08:14.460
I'm sorry.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:15.328
